%description:
The QoS rules of an Ethernet PDU session classify frames, which have no DSCP field: a
dscpAsQfi uplink rule scoped to the UE is an error of the core network (CoreControl) at
the session's establishment.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.NrSessionTestNetwork

*.upf.hasEthernetBridge = true
*.ue[*].sessionType = "Ethernet"
*.ue[*].hasIpv4 = false
*.bearerConfigurator.ulQfiRules = [{ue: "ue[0]", dscpAsQfi: true}]

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
CoreControl: NrSessionTestNetwork.ue[0] requests an Ethernet session, whose frames have no DSCP field, but a dscpAsQfi rule of the ulQfiRules parameter of the bearer configurator is scoped to it
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
